 "Thunberg", "(", "@GretaThunberg", ")", "February", "14", ",", "2023", "Likewise", ",", "Check", "Your", "Fact", "did", "not", "find", "the", "digitally", "altered", "X", "image", "in", "any", "recent", "credible", "news", "reports", "about", "Thunberg", ".", "In", "addition", ",", "a", "keyword", "search", "reveals", "that", "\u201c", "On", "The", "Jews", "And", "Their", "Lies", "\u201d", "is", "in", "fact", "an", "anti", "-", "Semitic", "work", "authored", "by", "Luther", ".", "(", "RELATED", ":", "Did", "Greta", "Thunberg", "Say", "We", "Must", "Switch", "To", "\u2018", "Sustainable", "Tanks", "And", "Weaponry", "\u2019", "?", ")", "A", "spokesperson", "for", "Thunberg", "confirmed", "the", "image", "was", "fake", "in", "an", "email", "to", "Check", "Your", "Fact", ".", "\u201c", "The", "image", "is", "fake", ",", "and", "the", "original", "was", "posted", "by", "Greta", "with", "\u2018", "The", "Climate", "Book", ",", "'", "\u201d", "the", "spokesperson", "said", "."], "sentence": "FACT CHECK: Viral X Image Purporting To Show Greta Thunberg Holding Anti-Semitic Book Is Digitally Altered \n\n FACT CHECK: Viral X Image Purporting To Show Greta Thunberg Holding Anti-Semitic Book Is Digitally Altered\n\nA viral image shared on X, formerly Twitter, purports to show 20-year-old Swedish climate activist Greta Thunberg holding an anti-Semitic book. \u2014 I,Hypocrite (@lporiginalg) November 28, 2023\n\nVerdict: False\n\nThe image is digitally altered. In the original image, shared via Thunberg\u2019s verified X account, she can be seen holding a copy of \u201cThe Climate Book.\u201d A spokesperson for Thunberg confirmed the image was fake in an email to Check Your Fact. Fact Check:\n\nThunberg has been criticized for chanting \u201ccrush Zionism\u201d at a recent pro-Palestine rally in Sweden, according to the Times of Israel. Nigel Savage, founder of the Jewish non-profit Hazon, said Thunberg and other members of the political left \u201chave been intellectually captured by a naive, distorted and frankly bigoted anti-Zionism,\u201d the outlet reported. The X image, viewed over 800,000 times, purports to show Thunberg holding an anti-Semitic book. \u201cOn The Jews And Their Lies,\u201d the title of the book appears to read. The book is supposedly written by German priest and theologian Martin Luther. The image is digitally altered, however. In the original image, shared via Thunberg\u2019s verified X account, she can be seen holding a copy of \u201cThe Climate Book.\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m so pleased to share that The Climate Book is now available in the USA and Canada! I have gathered the wisdom of over one hundred contributors to highlight the many different crises we face and equip us with the knowledge we need to avoid a climate disaster,\u201d Thunberg wrote in the first of two posts promoting the book. \u201cThis is the biggest story in the world, and it must be spoken as far and wide as our voices can carry and much further still. Thank you for your support! I will not earn money from this book as my copyright belongs to the Greta Thunberg Foundation, so all royalties go to charity,\u201d she added in the second post. I\u2019m so pleased to share that The Climate Book is now available in the USA and Canada! I have gathered the wisdom of over one hundred contributors to highlight the many different crises we face and equip us with the knowledge we need to avoid a climate disaster. 1/2 pic.twitter.com/z2AD32Oac1\n\n\u2014 Greta Thunberg (@GretaThunberg) February 14, 2023\n\nLikewise, Check Your Fact did not find the digitally altered X image in any recent credible news reports about Thunberg. In addition, a keyword search reveals that \u201cOn The Jews And Their Lies\u201d is in fact an anti-Semitic work authored by Luther. (RELATED: Did Greta Thunberg Say We Must Switch To \u2018Sustainable Tanks And Weaponry\u2019?) A spokesperson for Thunberg confirmed the image was fake in an email to Check Your Fact. \u201cThe image is fake, and the original was posted by Greta with \u2018The Climate Book,'\u201d the spokesperson said.", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Unattributed_information", "roles": [{"name": "Reported_fact", "filler": "To Show Greta Thunberg Holding Anti - Semitic Book", "idxs": [7, 15]}], "idxs": [6, 6], "activation": "Purporting"}, {"name": "Physical_artworks", "roles": [], "idxs": [40, 40], "activation": "image"}, {"name": "Unattributed_information", "roles": [{"name": "Reported_fact", "filler": "to show 20 - year - old Swedish climate activist Greta Thunberg holding an anti - Semitic book", "idxs": [49, 66]}], "idxs": [25, 25], "activation": "Purporting"}, {"name": "Cause_to_perceive", "roles": [{"name": "Phenomenon", "filler": "20 - year - old Swedish climate activist Greta Thunberg holding an anti - Semitic book", "idxs": [51, 66]}, {"name": "Medium", "filler": "A viral image shared on X , formerly Twitter", "idxs": [38, 46]}], "idxs": [50, 50], "activation": "show"}, {"name": "Wearing", "roles": [{"name": "Clothing", "filler": "Anti - Semitic Book", "idxs": [12, 15]}, {"name": "Wearer", "filler": "Greta Thunberg", "idxs": [9, 10]}], "idxs": [11, 11], "activation": "Holding"}, {"name": "Cause_change", "roles": [{"name": "Manner", "filler": "Digitally", "idxs": [17, 17]}, {"name": "Entity", "filler": "Greta Thunberg Holding Anti - Semitic Book", "idxs": [9, 15]}], "idxs": [18, 18], "activation": "Altered"}, {"name": "Origin", "roles": [{"name": "Origin", "filler": "Swedish", "idxs": [56, 56]}, {"name": "Entity", "filler": "climate activist Greta Thunberg", "idxs": [57, 60]}], "idxs": [56, 56], "activation": "Swedish"}, {"name": "Unattributed_information", "roles": [{"name": "Reported_fact", "filler": "show 20 - year - old Swedish climate activist Greta Thunberg holding an anti - Semitic book", "idxs": [50, 66]}], "idxs": [48, 49], "activation": "purports to"}, {"name": "Text", "roles": [{"name": "Genre", "filler": "anti - Semiti